      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE has just dropped its latest Fall/Winter 2026 bag charms, turning an eye to everyday objects—gnawed apple cores, peeled oranges, bottle openers, traffic cones, caterpillars, seashells, and more. Crafted with exquisite detail and a vibrant palette, these whimsical accessories inject a playful spirit into any handbag.",
