    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Unlike run-of-the-mill fruit motifs, these charms brim with life. A brass apple core 🍏, its flesh carved away, sits beside an orange peeled back to reveal plump calfskin segments, while green leather leaves stay perky. A fig pendant in sculpted brass with a purple skin and silver bead seeds looks irresistibly juicy.",
